### ClearWood Furnitures — Prompt 2 (Catalog domain) endpoint checks
### VS Code REST Client (humao.rest-client). Start the API first: npm run dev:backend
### The catalog must be migrated and seeded: npm run db:migrate && npm run db:seed

@baseUrl = http://localhost:7180
@apiPrefix = /api/v1

### 1. Whole category tree — 12 roots, 111 categories, nested and ordered (cached 5m)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/tree
Accept: application/json

### 2. Top level only
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/tree?depth=1
Accept: application/json

### 3. Include inactive categories (admin view)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/tree?depth=2&includeInactive=true
Accept: application/json

### 4. One category: breadcrumbs from the materialised path + children + INHERITED attributes
###    "fabric-sofas" defines no attributes of its own — everything comes from "sofas".
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/fabric-sofas
Accept: application/json

### 5. A child that OVERRIDES an inherited attribute (FABRIC becomes required here)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/leather-sofas
Accept: application/json

### 6. A top-level category with children
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/mattresses
Accept: application/json

### 7. Unknown category -> 404 error envelope with a traceId (R3)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/not-a-real-category
Accept: application/json

### 8. Malformed slug -> 422 with per-issue details (R2)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/categories/NOT_A_SLUG
Accept: application/json

### 9. Global attribute dictionary, paginated (R5 meta block)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/attributes?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### 10. Attributes resolved for a category (inherited set)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/attributes?categorySlug=fabric-sofas
Accept: application/json

### 11. Only the attributes a shopper can filter on
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/attributes?categorySlug=mattresses&filterableOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### 12. Sorting is allowlisted — an unknown field is rejected with 422 (R10)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/catalog/attributes?sort=dropTable&order=asc
Accept: application/json

### 13. The whole mega-menu, from the database (R9 — nothing hardcoded in React)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/navigation/MAIN
Accept: application/json

### 14. Footer menus and the top bar
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/navigation/FOOTER_PRIMARY
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/navigation/FOOTER_SECONDARY
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/navigation/TOP_BAR
Accept: application/json

### 15. Unknown menu key -> 422 (the key is a validated enum)
GET {{baseUrl}}{{apiPrefix}}/navigation/NOPE
Accept: application/json

### 16. A seeded placeholder asset served by the local StorageDriver
GET {{baseUrl}}/media/seed/kabir-3-seater-fabric-sofa-01.svg

### 17. The generated spec now carries the catalog schemas
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
Accept: application/json
